ектив<span class="arrow"></span></a><ul class="level_2 navbar-nav"><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/collective/administration">Администрация колледжа<span class="arrow"></span></a></li><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/collective/teachers">Педагогический коллектив<span class="arrow"></span></a></li><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/collective/employees">Cлужащие<span class="arrow"></span></a></li><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/collective/maintenance">Cлужащие АХЧ<span class="arrow"></span></a></li></ul></li><li class="parent nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/documents/registration-documents">Документы<span class="arrow"></span></a><ul class="level_2 navbar-nav"><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/documents/registration-documents">Регистрационные документы<span class="arrow"></span></a></li><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/documents/statute">Устав колледжа<span class="arrow"></span></a></li><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/documents/structure">Структура колледжа<span class="arrow"></span></a></li></ul></li><li class="parent nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/news">Архив новостей<span class="arrow"></span></a><ul class="level_2 navbar-nav"><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/news/arhiv-novostei-spiskom">Архив новостей (списком)<span class="arrow"></span></a></li></ul></li><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/announcements">Архив анонсов<span class="arrow"></span></a></li><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/experimental-innovative-activities">Экспериментальная и инновационная деятельность<span class="arrow"></span></a></li><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/union">Первичная профсоюзная организация<span class="arrow"></span></a></li><li class=" nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about/anti-corruption">Профилактика коррупции<span